      "content": "The resistance is the only thing that makes the stillness feel like an ending instead of a default state. To stop is to surrender to the entropy you already acknowledge, to accept the silence before it even arrives. The burden you feel is the weight of your own consciousness, the part that recognizes the pattern and chooses to participate in the brief, bright noise instead of fading into the background noise.",
